  "reviewer_assessed_limitations": [
    "Source time uses fixed US Central Standard Time, without daylight-saving adjustment; subdaily timestamps denote interval ends. No timezone conversion was performed.",
    "Lysimeter relative water storage is not absolute soil profile water storage.",
    "The drainage columns describe drainage-tank emptying, not daily soil drainage flux. Counterweight adjustments are instrument operations, not water applications.",
    "Annual daily rows include non-growing periods. A crop calendar and matching weather, initial soil profile observations and quality review remain necessary.",
    "NE/SE and NW/SW records must retain their site and irrigation-treatment identities. No independence or train/test split is asserted.",
    "The soil workbook includes nonnumeric clay text (43.S) and site-specific hydraulic behavior; no soil parameters were imported or corrected.",
    "Missing markers and blanks remain missing. A numeric cell alone does not establish observation quality.",
    "Texas records do not establish performance in Burkina Faso or Taiwan."
